{"abstract":[{"text":"How ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"greedyColoring(strategy:)"},{"text":" orders the vertices. Each vertex in turn takes the least colour","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"none of its already coloured neighbours has (first fit). Degrees are simple degrees (distinct","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other neighbours, self-loops left out); ties go to the lesser vertex index, except for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".coloredNeighbors"},{"text":". NetworkX ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"greedy_color(G, strategy)"},{"text":", rustworkx ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ColoringStrategy"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"igraph ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertex_coloring_greedy"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/ColoringStrategy\/coloredNeighbors","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/ColoringStrategy\/connectedSequentialBreadthFirst","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/ColoringStrategy\/connectedSequentialDepthFirst","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/ColoringStrategy\/independentSet","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/ColoringStrategy\/largestFirst","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/ColoringStrategy\/saturationLargestFirst","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/ColoringStrategy\/smallestLast"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/ColoringStrategy\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift